  "title": "Korean Fusion Chicken Burrito",
  "description": "Cook canned chicken with Korean chile paste to fill burritos with kimchi, cilantro, cheese, and salsa for a fusion of Korean and Mexican in a burrito.",
  "authors": [
    "Forevertiff"
  ],
